      "description": "The abstract proof systems capture selected properties of the arithmetic setting, not EA or the truth predicate of EA_T. In particular, `F φ` stands in for application to a Gödel code, and `Def5` assumes a provable diagonal biconditional rather than obtaining it by arithmetic coding."
